    "sections": {
        "description": "Feminine Store Rental is a chic, SEO-forward WordPress theme crafted for fashion boutiques, dress rental shops, and modern women’s brands aiming to boost engagement and sales. Seamlessly paired with WooCommerce, it simplifies online storefront setup and order management, while the stylish responsive design appeals to shoppers on every device. Enjoy high-speed performance, mobile optimization, and secure coding that help your store rank for “fashion boutique WordPress theme” or “dress rental website.” Customizable color schemes, banners, product galleries, and unique testimonial features create an inviting shopping environment and encourage conversion. CTA sections and flexible layout options guide users toward your featured outfits and easy rentals. Global shoppers benefit from multilingual and RTL support, while schema markup and accessible navigation push your site further in Google results. Feminine Store Rental delivers a blend of visual elegance, SEO mastery, and trust-building tools—connecting you with your target audience in a professional, human-centered way."
    },
